{"id":"n-djamena","name":"恩贾梅纳","en":"N'Djamena","country":"Chad","lat":12.115,"lng":15.0472,"dek":"两河交汇处，一座被烈日晒透的都城","history":"恩贾梅纳的位置从一开始就由水决定。沙里河与洛贡河在此汇合，撒哈拉沙漠南缘的队商把这里当作歇脚与交易的站点，家畜、谷物、食盐和枣椰沿河集散。河给了这座城市第一层身份：一个可以停下来的地方。\n\n19世纪80年代，法国人来到这里，城市沦为殖民地。1900年建城时，它叫拉密堡。1960年乍得独立，首都定在此地，城市随国家机构一起长大，榨油、面粉、纺织、肉类加工陆续出现，沙里河上的港口把内地与邻国连起来。\n\n1973年，城市改称恩贾梅纳。此后数十年，乍得经历内战与动荡，国家博物馆的藏品在 loot 中散失，一些索奥陶塑被列入非洲考古对象红色名录，提醒各地的拍卖行与海关留意。今天的恩贾梅纳仍是全国最大的城市与交通枢纽，几条横贯非洲的公路在此交会，城市在河水与旱季之间继续生长。","culture":"恩贾梅纳的居民由乍得阿拉伯人、萨拉人、马萨人等构成。阿拉伯人多信奉伊斯兰教，萨拉人与马萨人多保持传统信仰。法语和阿拉伯语是官方语言，萨拉语在日常里广泛使用。这种多语并存的状态，让城市的市场、清真寺与教堂各自成片，又彼此相邻。\n\n城市的文化生活绕不开宗教建筑与河。清真寺散布各处，天主教堂与总统府也是常见的城市地标，拍照时需留意。沙里河上的桥是看落日的地方，傍晚的光落在水面上，宽阔而缓慢。2009年，恩贾梅纳被选为伊斯兰文化之都，宗教与城市生活的关系被重新提起。","pull":"河在这里汇合，城在旱季里长大。","sights":[{"name":"乍得国家博物馆","orig":"Musée National du Tchad","intro":"馆内保存着乍得历史的实物，包括索奥文化的陶塑。内战中部分藏品被劫掠流失，索奥陶塑因此被列入非洲考古对象红色名录，提醒拍卖行与海关注意。如今的收藏规模小了许多，参观者仍能看到索奥文物。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Mus%C3%A9e_national_2.jpg/960px-Mus%C3%A9e_national_2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":540},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chad_National_Museum"},{"name":"恩贾梅纳大清真寺","orig":"Grande Mosquée de N'Djamena","intro":"恩贾梅纳的主要清真寺，也是城市伊斯兰生活的中心。建筑体量不大，却因位置与日常礼拜而成为城市肌理的一部分。非礼拜时间可以在外围感受它的存在，进入时需尊重当地的着装与行为习惯。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fd/Mosqu%C3%A9e_Roi_Fay%C3%A7al_de_N%27djamena.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":546},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/N'Djamena_Grand_Mosque"},{"name":"沙里河桥","orig":"Pont sur le Chari","intro":"横跨沙里河的桥，连接恩贾梅纳与对岸。桥上是看河与看落日的地方，傍晚水面被光铺开，河风比城里凉。过桥的人流与车流不断，是观察城市日常节奏的一个位置。","img":null,"src":null},{"name":"沙里河落日","orig":"Coucher de soleil sur le Chari","intro":"沙里河在城边流过，河面宽阔，傍晚的落日是恩贾梅纳最常被提起的景象。找一处河岸或桥上站定，看光从水面退去，城市的声音在身后慢慢低下来。无需门票，时间对了就有。","img":null,"src":null},{"name":"恩贾梅纳天主教堂","orig":"Cathédrale de N'Djamena","intro":"城市里的天主教堂，与散布各处的清真寺一起构成恩贾梅纳的宗教地图。建筑不张扬，日常有礼拜活动。参观时保持安静，避开礼拜时段，是对当地人的基本尊重。","img":null,"src":null}],"foods":[{"name":"上尉鱼","orig":"Capitaine","intro":"沙里河出产的鱼，当地人称“沙里王子”。肉质紧实，常见做法是烤或煎，配米饭或木薯。河边的餐馆多有供应，吃的是鱼本身的味道与河的风。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/28/%28Narbonne%29_D%C3%A9fense_h%C3%A9ro%C3%AFque_du_capitaine_Leli%C3%A8vre_%C3%A0_Mazagran_%28F%C3%A9vrier_1840%29_-_Jean-Adolphe_Beauc%C3%A9_-_Mus%C3%A9e_des_Beaux-Arts_de_Narbonne.jpg/960px-%28Narbonne%29_D%C3%A9fense_h%C3%A9ro%C3%AFque_du_capitaine_Leli%C3%A8vre_%C3%A0_Mazagran_%28F%C3%A9vrier_1840%29_-_Jean-Adolphe_Beauc%C3%A9_-_Mus%C3%A9e_des_Beaux-Arts_de_Narbonne.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":774},"src":null},{"name":"枣椰","orig":"Dattes","intro":"撒哈拉队商贸易里的老角色，恩贾梅纳是枣椰的集散地之一。果实晒干后甜而耐放，市场上成堆出售，是城市里最容易买到的甜味。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Phoenix_dactylifera2.jpg/960px-Phoenix_dactylifera2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1280},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A4%B0%E6%A3%97"},{"name":"小米粥","orig":"Boule de mil","intro":"以小米制成的团状主食，配汤汁或酱料用手取食。是乍得与萨赫勒一带的日常饭食，朴素、顶饱，在市场与街边小摊都能遇到。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Boule_de_mil.jpg/960px-Boule_de_mil.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1280},"src":null},{"name":"花生","orig":"Arachide","intro":"乍得的花生是集散与加工的大宗，恩贾梅纳有榨油与相关的小型工业。炒过的花生在市场上论堆卖，也是佐餐与旅途里的零嘴。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Arachis_hypogaea_-_K%C3%B6hler%E2%80%93s_Medizinal-Pflanzen-163.jpg/960px-Arachis_hypogaea_-_K%C3%B6hler%E2%80%93s_Medizinal-Pflanzen-163.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1426},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%B1%E7%94%9F"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/National_Museum_and_National_Library_of_Chad_in_N%27Djamena_-_2014-10-01_a.jpg/1280px-National_Museum_and_National_Library_of_Chad_in_N%27Djamena_-_2014-10-01_a.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":584},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Building_of_National_Assembly_DJAMENA.jpg/1280px-Building_of_National_Assembly_DJAMENA.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":960}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[14.8857021,12.1697989],[14.8855305,12.1652262],[14.8889637,12.160171],[14.9049711,12.15113],[14.9098849,12.1467668],[14.9158499,12.140302],[14.922834,12.1286],[14.9425006,12.1127395],[14.9530148,12.1016619],[14.9585222,12.0982974],[14.9657229,12.0964061],[14.9690065,12.0934896],[14.9819854,12.0880948],[14.9900776,12.0869513],[14.9936959,12.0883203],[14.9957612,12.0946856],[14.9957478,12.099388],[14.9953817,12.1008029],[14.993881,12.1010272],[14.9929637,12.1024748],[14.9901804,12.1099002],[14.9936548,12.1156171],[14.9993419,12.1206698],[15.0026953,12.1214262],[15.0078779,12.1202908],[15.0183173,12.11757],[15.0262459,12.1143066],[15.0330047,12.1094821],[15.0377795,12.1040723],[15.0348382,12.0853783],[15.0369071,12.078066],[15.0390757,12.0757992],[15.0469524,12.0740929],[15.0502177,12.0720454],[15.0557763,12.0642453],[15.060263,12.0599795],[15.060153,12.0542935],[15.1008978,12.0539646],[15.154522,12.0664958],[15.1825726,12.0953299],[15.1593371,12.1267433],[15.1252146,12.1673751],[15.0853219,12.1969274],[15.0671442,12.200856],[15.0274999,12.2169586],[15.0262043,12.2534873],[14.9029321,12.2248606],[14.9017632,12.2213305],[14.8966885,12.2156997],[14.8940492,12.2111802],[14.89259,12.2059423],[14.8927617,12.2029275],[14.8946285,12.1988692],[14.8981476,12.1958281],[14.9067199,12.1933532],[14.9094987,12.19156],[14.9108398,12.1884664],[14.9106038,12.1851524],[14.9085867,12.1816707],[14.9043703,12.1791957],[14.8894143,12.1744554],[14.8857021,12.1697989]]]},"credit":{"model":"deepseek-flash","wiki":{"zh":"恩賈梅納","en":"N'Djamena","voyage":"N'Djamena"}}}